00:14:02.200 --> 00:14:03.380
- You the man.

00:14:03.380 --> 00:14:05.460
- His popularity was at an all time high

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:08.170
and in 1999, he even starred in a movie.

00:14:08.170 --> 00:14:09.900
Even the title is a testament to how

00:14:09.900 --> 00:14:12.070
overzealous Charles was during this time.

00:14:12.070 --> 00:14:13.830
Many movies around the
turn of the millennium

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:15.830
utilized the number 2000 in their title.

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:18.477
Like "Pokemon 2000," Blues Brothers 2000,"

00:14:18.477 --> 00:14:20.817
"Heavy Metal 2000," "Godzilla 2000,"

00:14:20.817 --> 00:14:23.550
"Fantasia 2000" and "Dracula 2000."

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:26.240
Charles Entertainment Cheese
was apparently not satisfied

00:14:26.240 --> 00:14:27.900
with simply one upping these titles,

00:14:27.900 --> 00:14:29.407
instead opting to call his movie,

00:14:29.407 --> 00:14:32.300
"Chuck E. Cheese in the Galaxy 5000."

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:33.890
The movie begins with the gang meeting

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:35.040
in an unnamed restaurant

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:36.420
that is cleaner than any Chuck E. Cheese

00:14:36.420 --> 00:14:37.330
