They kidnap her, planning
to turn her into zoom gas

00:17:10.190 --> 00:17:12.390
'cause apparently the main
ingredient is chicken.

00:17:12.390 --> 00:17:14.440
Meanwhile, Chuck E. with a cave hermit

00:17:14.440 --> 00:17:15.850
